    "flavor_text": {
      "one_line": "Gormdurn — xenophobic theocratic of the volcanic mountains; piety, honor.",
      "one_paragraph": "The Gormdurn (Dwarf) are a assertive theocratic people seeded in volcanic mountains. They prize piety, honor, strength, lean toward the military sphere, and field heavy_infantry, crossbowmen, berserkers. Outsiders are met as xenophobic; their patrons touch fire, death, mountains."
